# Main Catalog Page Rules

- Keep the first screen conversion-focused: clear title, short value proposition, visible primary CTA.
- Place filter/sort controls above the card grid and keep them usable on mobile.
- Keep category chips and controls keyboard-accessible with visible focus states.
- Show result counts and active filters so users understand what they see.
- Include designed empty state for no-results filtering.
- Keep card CTA labels action-oriented and consistent.

## Section Order

- Hero/value proposition.
- Filters and quick categories.
- Catalog grid.
- Trust/proof section.
- FAQ and final CTA.
